cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Kodecz in your work, please cite it as below."
title: "Kodecz: video as a web page, rendered on an NVIDIA GPU or any CPU"
abstract: "Open-source video rendering engine that turns a web page into an MP4, frame by frame, on an NVIDIA GPU (NVENC) or on any CPU (x264), without a screenshot of every frame. Made to be driven by AI agents."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/konecz/kodecz"
url: "https://konecz.com"
authors:
